      "There are two of you. There is the one reading this, and there is the one assembled out of your scroll speed, your hesitations, the thing you searched at two in the morning and the thing you nearly bought and did not.",
      "Only one of those two is commercially interesting, and it is not you.",
      "## The double you build on purpose",
      "Some of it is deliberate. The photograph you picked, the job title you use, the opinions you are willing to have in public. Everybody does this and it is not dishonesty \u2014 you have always spoken differently to your boss than to your oldest friends. Online it simply happens in front of all of them at once, so the performance gets more careful.",
      "But the deliberate half is the small half, and it is not the half anybody is buying.",
      "## The double that gets built for you",
      "The valuable version is assembled without your involvement, out of things you would never think to say about yourself.",
      "Not your age and your postcode. Those are cheap and everyone has them. What is worth money is the shape of your worry. How fast you scroll. Where you slowed down. Which clip you watched twice. The half second of hesitation before you carried on.",
